     A** Group/State CodeReveiw usage file - Indicates what CodeReview*
     A** modules are to be used for a certain group/State             *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  Created by: C:79    Project: 114MDC   Date: 04/24/02         *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  REVISIONS:                                                   *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PSX01                     TEXT('Group CodeReview usage file')
     A            SXCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('COMPANY#')
     A            SXSUB#    R               REFFLD(SUB#)
     A                                      COLHDG('SUBSCRIBER')
     A            SXFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A                                      COLHDG('GROUP')
     A            SXST      R               REFFLD(ST)
     A                                      COLHDG('State')
     A            SXCRVW    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('CodeReview' 'module')
     A*                    Valid Values:
     A*                           Based on generic table id: CRVW
     A*
     A            SXEFDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Effective' 'Date')
     A            SXEXDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Expiration' 'Date')
     A            SXKBID    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('Knowledge' 'Base ID')
     A            SXSTAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            SXUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'User')
     A            SXPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'Pgm')
     A            SXTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'Time')
     A            SXDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'Date')
     A            SXIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Init' 'User')
     A            SXIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Init' 'Pgm')
     A            SXITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Init' 'Time')
     A            SXIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Init' 'Date')
